# Claude — ignore everything except the project-level config worth sharing.
# Note the `/*`: ignoring the directory itself would make the re-includes below
# unreachable, since git never descends into an excluded directory.
# Deliberately still ignored: settings.local.json (per-machine permissions) and
# worktrees/ (multi-GB working copies of this very repo).
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/agents/

